        "summary": "Tetranuclear Dy(III) SMM with a parallelogram [Dy4(OCH2-)4] core and two distinct Dy coordination environments, showing two-step magnetic relaxation (Orbach) with Ueff = 44 K (τ0 = 1.0 × 10^-6 s) and 107 K (τ0 = 2.0 × 10^-7 s). Dual relaxation persists under 2000 Oe dc field with essentially unchanged barriers. Cole–Cole plots at 5–11 K fit the sum of two modified Debye functions with small α values. A narrow hysteresis is observed at 1.9 K.",
